# Backend base URL. Leave unset to run the app in demo mode (no server needed).
#
# Local backend:
#   VITE_API_URL=http://localhost:4000/api/v1
#
# Production: set this as a build-time variable on the host, not in this file.
#   - Cloudflare Pages: Project → Settings → Variables and Secrets → add
#     VITE_API_URL for the Production (and Preview) environments.
#   - GitHub Actions (.github/workflows/deploy.yml): Repo → Settings → Secrets
#     and variables → Actions → Variables → VITE_API_URL.
